# The AXI/L2 route table is safety-critical -- its deadlock-freedom depends on the
# turn model and on nx tie-breaking -- so it is TRACKED: a silent routing change
# must show up in a diff. Note this needs `generated/*` above, not `generated`:
# git cannot re-include a file inside an ignored DIRECTORY.
